@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: MVP core / cross-cutting. Core presentation/application/files or shared authority/recovery invariant remains applicable.
title Resumefolio | UC-D03 protected viewer and direct retrieval
skinparam backgroundColor #101827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F1F5F9
skinparam hyperlinkColor #A9D0FF
skinparam dpi 216
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #9FB2CD
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #1C3453
skinparam participantBorderColor #9FB2CD
skinparam actorBorderColor #F1F5F9
actor "Employer viewer\nNo product account" as V
participant "Shared interaction\nConceptual responsibility" as UI
participant "Current access / selection rules\nConceptual responsibility" as A
participant "Protected artifact delivery\nConceptual responsibility" as F
V -> UI: Open controlled link and provide password
UI -> A: Check eligible link / password / intended resource
alt eligible and authorized
 A --> UI: Scoped sharing context only
 UI --> V: Intended selected resume / evidence
 V -> F: Request file or PDF (including direct path)
 F -> A: Check current request authority, selection\nand requested variant availability
 alt authorized and permitted artifact usable
  A --> F: Permit only intended resource
  F --> V: Permitted content
 else denied / unselected / unavailable
  A --> F: Bounded denied / unavailable result
  F --> V: No prohibited content; defined feedback
 end
else wrong password / disabled / ineligible
 A --> UI: No protected sharing authorization
 UI --> V: Defined access feedback; no protected content
end
note over V,F #49351C
Lifelines are responsibilities, not selected services or check ordering.
Active sessions, caches, in-flight changes and missing-language behavior remain open.
Disabling access cannot remove a copy already legitimately downloaded.
end note
@enduml
